    measurement of Groth16/SHA-256 chunk weights &le; 380 kWU, peak stack &le; 1,000, GPU prover time &le; 15 min),
    <strong>G-9</strong> (depth-256 Multi-Tx challenge fuzzer), <strong>G-11</strong> (<code>IssueMinted &rarr;
    ReceiveTreasury</code> unit tests), <strong>G-18</strong> (Signet&harr;Zenon PTLC/HTLC adversarial swap suite),
    the public Groth16 Phase-2 CRS ceremony (<code>K &ge; 50</code>), and upstream ratification of
    <code>SPEC.md §6</code> (<code>A-SPEC-1..6</code>, <code>A-BTC-1</code>, <code>A-MINT-1</code>,
